      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_A8ddyW": {
          "settings": {
            "filled_icon": false,
            "heading": "Can I use these on cats too?",
            "icon": "",
            "page": "",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Yes!</strong> All three products are safe and effective for both dogs and cats.</p><p><strong>Tips for cats:</strong></p><ul><li>Start slowly - cats are more particular about handling</li><li>Choose calm moments (after meals or naps)</li><li>Be extra gentle - cats have sensitive skin</li><li>Quick wipes work better than long sessions</li><li>Use high-value treats for cooperation</li></ul><p>The formulas work identically on cats. Many customers use them on multi-pet households with both dogs and cats.</p>"
          },
          "type": "collapsible_row"
        },
        "collapsible_row_ErVBdA": {
          "settings": {
            "filled_icon": false,
            "heading": "Will this prevent ear infections?",
            "icon": "",
            "page": "",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes - regular cleaning significantly reduces infection risk by removing the wax and moisture where bacteria thrive.</p><p><strong>How it works:</strong> Ear infections happen when wax, dirt, and moisture build up, creating an environment for bacteria and yeast. EarWipes remove that buildup before infections can start.</p><p><strong>Best for prevention:</strong> If your dog is prone to ear infections (common in breeds like Cocker Spaniels, Basset Hounds, Labs), weekly cleaning can break the cycle and reduce vet visits.</p><p><strong>Already infected?</strong> See your vet first. Start using EarWipes after treatment to prevent recurrence.</p>"
          },
          "type": "collapsible_row"
        },
        "collapsible_row_GiwTCH": {
          "settings": {
            "filled_icon": false,
            "heading": "How long does one container last?",
            "icon": "",
            "page": "",
            "row_content": "<p>Depends on the product and how many pets you have:</p><p><strong>FreshWipes (50 wipes):</strong></p><ul><li>1 dog, daily use: ~50 days (1.5 months)</li><li>2 dogs, daily use: ~25 days</li></ul><p><strong>EyeWipes (100 wipes):</strong></p><ul><li>1 dog, daily use: ~50 days (2 wipes per day)</li><li>2 dogs, daily use: ~25 days</li></ul><p><strong>EarWipes (50 wipes):</strong></p><ul><li>1 dog, 2x per week: ~3-6 months</li><li>1 dog after swimming: varies</li></ul><p><strong>Complete Care Kit:</strong><br/><br/>~2-3 months of comprehensive daily care for one dog.</p>"
          },
          "type": "collapsible_row"
        },
        "collapsible_row_aAM8Eq": {
          "settings": {
            "filled_icon": false,
            "heading": "Will this help old, stubborn tear stains?",
            "icon": "",
            "page": "",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, but older stains take longer to fade.</p><p><strong>Timeline:</strong></p><ul><li>Fresh stains (weeks old): 3-7 days</li><li>Moderate stains (1-3 months): 2 weeks</li><li>Old stains (months/years): 3-4 weeks</li></ul><p><strong>Why it works:</strong> Daily use removes existing buildup while preventing new stains from setting. Most customers see visible improvement within 2 weeks.</p><p><strong>Important:</strong> Tear staining is ongoing - your dog's eyes keep producing tears. Daily cleaning stops new stains and gradually fades old ones.</p>"
          },
          "type": "collapsible_row"
        },
        "collapsible_row_eTY6yM": {
          "settings": {
            "filled_icon": false,
            "heading": "Is FreeshWipes a substitute for toothbrushing?",
            "icon": "",
            "page": "",
            "row_content": "<p>FreshWipes aren't a perfect replacement for brushing, but they're close - and they're what most dogs will actually tolerate.</p><p><strong>Here's the reality:</strong> Brushing is ideal, but most dogs resist it and most owners give up. FreshWipes use the same mechanical cleaning action as a toothbrush (physically removing plaque), just in a format your dog won't fight.</p><p><strong>Bottom line:</strong> A wipe you use daily beats a toothbrush that sits unused. Consistent care is what prevents dental problems, and FreshWipes make that possible.</p>"
          },
          "type": "collapsible_row"
        },
        "collapsible_row_ggVhDq": {
          "settings": {
            "filled_icon": false,
            "heading": "How long does shipping take?",
            "icon": "",
            "page": "",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Delivery Time:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Standard:</strong> 1-2 days handling + 5-10 days shipping</li><li><strong>Priority:</strong> 1-2 days handling + 4-7 days shipping</li></ul><p><strong>Tracking:</strong> You'll receive a tracking number via email as soon as your order ships from our warehouse.</p><p><strong>Questions?</strong> Email <a href=\"mailto:info@shopvetpets.com\">info@shopvetpets.com</a> - we reply within 24 hours on weekdays.</p>"
          },
          "type": "collapsible_row"
        },
        "collapsible_row_pYyTgC": {
          "settings": {
            "filled_icon": false,
            "heading": "Are all products safe for my pet?",
            "icon": "",
            "page": "",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. All three products (FreshWipes, EyeWipes, EarWipes) are formulated with pet safety as the top priority:</p><p><strong>FreshWipes:</strong></p><ul><li>Non-toxic, food-grade ingredients</li><li>Safe if swallowed or licked</li><li>No harsh chemicals, alcohol, or artificial flavors</li><li>Vet-approved formula</li></ul><p><strong>EyeWipes:</strong></p><ul><li>pH-balanced for sensitive eye area</li><li>Non-irritating, even if formula gets in eyes</li><li>Won't sting or burn</li><li>Gentle enough for daily use</li></ul><p><strong>EarWipes:</strong></p><ul><li>Alcohol-free formula (won't irritate ear canal)</li><li>Non-toxic if licked during grooming</li><li>Gentle on sensitive ear tissue</li><li>Safe for regular preventive use</li></ul><p>All products are manufactured to veterinary standards and contain no ingredients that could harm your pet, even with repeated daily use.</p>"
          },
          "type": "collapsible_row"
        },
        "collapsible_row_tzUTRG": {
          "settings": {
            "filled_icon": false,
            "heading": "Do I need all three products?",
            "icon": "",
            "page": "",
            "row_content": "<p>Each product addresses different needs - teeth, eyes, or ears. You can start with one, but most dogs benefit from all three areas.</p><p><strong>Here's why customers choose the Complete Kit:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Save 20%</strong> vs buying products separately</li><li><strong>Cover all three problem areas</strong> vets check most often</li><li><strong>One routine</strong> handles everything in under 2 minutes</li><li><strong>Prevent expensive vet bills</strong> across dental, eye, and ear issues</li></ul><p><strong>Start with what matters most to your dog right now.</strong> Many customers begin with FreshWipes for dental care, see results, then add EyeWipes and EarWipes for complete preventive care.</p><p>The Kit makes it simple and saves money - but choose what works for you.</p>"
          },
          "type": "collapsible_row"
        },
        "collapsible_row_z7xrwD": {
          "settings": {
            "filled_icon": false,
            "heading": "How does the 100-day money-back guarantee work?",
            "icon": "",
            "page": "",
            "row_content": "<p>We truly believe our products will make a difference for both you and your dog. That's why we offer a <strong>100-day money-back guarantee</strong> - not the standard 30 days.</p><p><strong>Why 100 days?</strong> Because we want you to really try the products, see results, and build a routine without feeling rushed. Some dogs take a few weeks to adjust, and real results show up with consistent use.</p><p><strong>How it works:</strong></p><ol><li>Try the products at home, in your own time</li><li>Not completely satisfied? Email us at info@shopvetpets.com</li><li>We'll refund you - no stress, no hassle, no complicated forms</li></ol><p><strong>What's covered:</strong></p><ul><li>Full purchase price refunded</li><li>Works on single products or Complete Kit</li><li>No restocking fees</li><li>You can even keep partially used containers</li></ul><p><strong>Our philosophy:</strong> It's more important that your dog gets the care they deserve than that you keep something you don't love. If it's not right for you, we want to make it right.</p><p><strong>To start a return:</strong> Email info@shopvetpets.com with your order number and we'll take care of the rest within 3-5 business days.</p>"
          },
          "type": "collapsible_row"
        }
      },
