            "text": "<p>Plaque builds up every single day, eventually hardening into tartar that causes bad breath, infections, and expensive vet bills. Toothbrushes work best - but most dogs fight them. Dental powders are easy - but lack the mechanical cleaning teeth actually need.</p><p><strong>FreshWipes give you the cleaning power of a brush with the ease of a quick wipe.</strong></p>",
            "title": "Teeth 🦷"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_N7Pa4L": {
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Namnlos_design_-_2026-01-25T040850.470.jpg",
            "link": "shopify://products/earwipes-kit-protects-against-ear-problems",
            "link_label": "Shop EarWipes",
            "muted_autoplay": true,
            "text": "<p>Wax and moisture naturally build up in your dog's ears, creating the perfect environment for bacteria and yeast infections. Most owners don't notice until there's a smell or their dog is scratching constantly - by then, it's often already infected.</p><p><strong>Regular cleaning with EarWipes helps prevent infections before they start, removing buildup quickly and gently.</strong></p>",
            "title": "Ears 👂"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_kaPqz7": {
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Namnlos_design_-_2026-01-25T040543.697.jpg",
            "link": "shopify://products/eyewipes-prevention-that-keeps-eyes-clear",
            "link_label": "Shop EyeWipes",
            "muted_autoplay": true,
            "text": "<p>Tear stains aren't just cosmetic - the constant moisture around your dog's eyes creates a breeding ground for bacteria and yeast. Left untreated, this can lead to irritation, infections, and discomfort.</p><p><strong>EyeWipes gently remove buildup and moisture daily, helping prevent problems before they start.</strong></p>",
            "title": "Eyes 👀"
          },
          "type": "column"
        }
      },
