            "link_label": "",
            "muted_autoplay": true,
            "text": "<p>Cetylpyridinium Chloride (CPC) is clinically proven to eliminate up to 99% of the bacteria that cause plaque buildup and bad breath — the same active ingredient used in professional dental mouthwashes.</p>",
            "title": "1. Antibacterial CPC Formula"
