            "link": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "muted_autoplay": true,
            "text": "<p>The textured surface acts like a micro-toothbrush, physically removing plaque and food debris — without the discomfort dogs associate with traditional brushing.</p>",
            "title": "2. Mechanical Cleaning"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_9WQacg": {
