        "column_qb88rE",
        "column_WRiJX3"
      ],
      "blocks": {
        "column_BTnNrC": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "Maria L., 41 | Golden Retriever - 2025-10-03",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>We have a 3-year-old at home and the dog licks him constantly around him. I wanted something gentle that wouldn't irritate if it got in his eyes. These are natural and work really well. Takes 2 minutes in the evening. His eye area looks so much cleaner now and no more redness. Great not to have to worry.</p>",
            "title": "Safe for sensitive eyes"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_BgwVTr": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "– John Taylor",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/profilbild.webp",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>A great product that really makes a difference. I’ve noticed that my dog’s tartar has significantly reduced and his breath is much fresher.<br/><br/>Plus, it’s very easy to use.</p><p></p>",
            "title": "A great product that really makes a difference"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_EyT3yh": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "Sophie H., 43 - 2025-10-26",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>Really good. I've tried chew toys, water additives, everything possible. Nothing worked and my dog's breath was TERRIBLE. These wipes actually remove the dirt, you see it directly on the wipe. Takes max 2 minutes and I can do it while watching TV. Should've bought these ages ago.</p>",
            "title": "Finally something that actually works"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_JxijFr": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "Christine B. - 2025-09-21",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>My dog wasn't fond of it at first. But now it's going better. It works.</p>",
            "title": "Getting better each time"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_M8VjaY": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "– Sarah Johansen",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/Profilbild_3.webp",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>I’ve always had a hard time brushing my dog’s teeth because he was afraid.<br/><br/>With these wipes, he’s now completely calm.<br/><br/>It’s such a huge relief to be able to clean his teeth without having to fight with him.<br/><br/><strong>Highly recommend this to all dog owners.</strong></p>",
            "title": "Highly recommend to all dog owners"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_PkYcKz": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "Anne B., 57 - 2025-11-09",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>Talked to my vet about dental care and she said the most important thing is to do SOMETHING regularly, even if you can't brush. These wipes have made it so much easier for me to keep the routine. My 11-year-old dachshund has noticeably whiter teeth and I feel safe using the natural ingredients. Takes barely a minute a day. Highly recommend!</p>",
            "title": "Vet said do something this works"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_WRiJX3": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "– Margaret Davies",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/Profilbild3_98453ffc-28e5-4418-89bd-9cc2393e092a.webp",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>My dog seems to like it, and I can see an improvement in his oral health.</p>",
            "title": "I see an improvement in his oral health"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_WzDbWA": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "– Simon Andersson",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/Profilbild1.webp",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>I’ve used this product on my dog for a few weeks now, and I’m very satisfied.<br/><br/>His teeth look much cleaner, and his breath has noticeably improved.<br/><br/>It’s also very easy to use, which is a big plus.</p>",
            "title": "I’m very satisfied"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_ccnzHG": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "Sarah E., 39 - 2025-10-03",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>We have a 3-year-old at home and the dog licks him constantly. I wanted something for the dog's breath that isn't dangerous if the kids get it on them. These are natural and work really well. Takes 2 minutes in the evening when the kids are asleep. The dog sits calmly and his breath is so much fresher now. Great not to have to worry when he kisses the kids!</p>",
            "title": "Safe for the whole family"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_qb88rE": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "– Sofia Jones",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/Profilbild1.jpg",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>My dog likes it, and it’s easy to use every day.<br/><br/>Delivers great results.</p>",
            "title": "Delivers great results"
          },
          "type": "column"
        },
        "column_tUC9cB": {
          "settings": {
            "author": "– Johan E",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/Profilbild1_78735bd1-dd93-45c0-b80c-27246ca5802d.webp",
            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>Brushing my dog’s teeth has been a struggle for years because he was so scared.<br/><br/>But these wipes changed everything.<br/><br/>He’s now completely fearless and lets me clean his teeth without any problems.<br/><br/>This has truly improved our dental care routine.</p>",
            "title": "He’s completely fearless now!"
          },
