            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>My Golden has been digging at his ears for MONTHS. Like every few minutes, constantly. I tried wiping them with wet paper towels, bought those expensive ear drops from the pet store - he hated these and would literally hide under the bed when he saw me coming. Started using these wipes about 2 weeks ago and the scratching is almost completely gone. The smell disappeared too which is honestly the best part because his face used to reek. He just sits there now, doesn't even try to pull away.</p>",
            "title": "The scratching has stopped"
