            "star_rating": 5,
            "text": "<p>My Bichon used to wake up with those brown areas every single day. I tried everything - baby wipes, damp cloths, nothing worked properly. These actually remove the gunk and it doesn't come back as quickly. Takes about a week to see real improvement but now her eyes look so much cleaner. Finally something that works</p>",
